		{"id":"g0001frontend0001","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":760,"height":420,"label":"Frontend  ·  src/app + src/components","color":"5"},
		{"id":"t0001appshell001","type":"text","x":30,"y":60,"width":320,"height":110,"text":"## AppShell + Sidebar\n\n`layout.tsx` (RTL, Heebo) wraps every page. Sidebar lists all active projects from DB.","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f0001allviewdoc1","type":"file","x":380,"y":60,"width":340,"height":110,"file":"vault/03 Views/All.md"},
		{"id":"t0002placeholders","type":"text","x":30,"y":200,"width":690,"height":100,"text":"## Placeholder views (Sprint 2)\n\n[[Inbox]] · [[Today]] · [[Week]] — קיימות כ-`page.tsx` עם הודעת \"בקרוב\". כל אחת תקבל לוגיקה אחרת ב-Sprint 2."},
		{"id":"t0003pageaction00","type":"text","x":30,"y":320,"width":690,"height":70,"text":"→ כל page קוראת ל-server actions ב-`src/lib/actions/` דרך form/dialog (ראה [[Server Actions Pattern]])."},
		{"id":"g0002actions0001","type":"group","x":800,"y":0,"width":480,"height":420,"label":"Server Actions  ·  src/lib/actions","color":"2"},
		{"id":"t0004taskstsnod1","type":"text","x":830,"y":60,"width":420,"height":150,"text":"## tasks.ts\n\n**7 actions:** `createTask`, `updateTask`, `completeTask`, `reopenTask`, `archiveTask`, `restoreTask`, `softDeleteTask`.\n\nכל אחד עוטף ב-`prisma.$transaction` ויוצר [[TaskEvent]].","color":"2"},
		{"id":"t0005projectstsno","type":"text","x":830,"y":230,"width":420,"height":160,"text":"## projects.ts\n\n**4 actions:** `createProject`, `updateProject`, `archiveProject`, `softDeleteProject`.\n\n`MAX_DEPTH = 3` להיררכיה. softDelete חוסם אם יש משימות פעילות.","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g0003validators01","type":"group","x":1320,"y":0,"width":380,"height":420,"label":"Validators  ·  Zod","color":"3"},
		{"id":"t0006taskvalidato","type":"text","x":1350,"y":60,"width":320,"height":150,"text":"## validators/task.ts\n\n`taskCreateSchema` + `taskUpdateSchema` (partial).\n\n`STATUS_LABELS`, `PRIORITY_LABELS`, `PRIORITY_COLORS` — מקור אמת לעברית בכל ה-UI.","color":"3"},
		{"id":"t0007projectvalid","type":"text","x":1350,"y":230,"width":320,"height":150,"text":"## validators/project.ts\n\n`projectCreateSchema` + 8 צבעי `PROJECT_COLOR_PRESETS`.\n\nכל הודעת שגיאה בעברית (`'יש להזין שם'`, `'צבע HEX לא תקין'`).","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g0004domainph1001","type":"group","x":0,"y":470,"width":1280,"height":500,"label":"Domain — Phase 1 (active)","color":"4"},
