		{"id":"t0009prismadbsing","type":"text","x":480,"y":1080,"width":540,"height":150,"text":"## src/lib/db.ts\n\nPrisma 7 client (output ל-`src/generated/prisma/`) עם `PrismaBetterSqlite3` adapter.\n\n`DATABASE_URL=file:./dev.db` ב-`.env`. יבוא תמיד דרך `import { prisma } from '@/lib/db'`.","color":"6"},
